{
  "_comment": "English text for the baked full-page memo images (CPC_*.BIN, one page per Act 1 scene bank). Rendered by tools/gfxpages.py. Lines are laid out as written; the tool reports any line that overruns its page.",
  "CPC_B000": [
    "[NOTES ON THE SNATCHERS]",
    "",
    "Why do they only show up",
    "once winter sets in?",
    "Why do they move at night?",
    "I have the answer now."
  ],
  "CPC_B010": [
    "Their vampire-like habits",
    "all serve one purpose:",
    "keeping out of sunlight.",
    "They shun it because",
    "their artificial skin is",
    "flawed."
  ],
  "CPC_B020": [
    "Hold that artificial skin",
    "under ultraviolet long",
    "enough and the melanocytes",
    "in its base layer multiply",
    "out of control, into what",
    "amounts to a skin cancer."
  ],
  "CPC_B030": [
    "What we would call a",
    "suntan kills them."
  ],
  "CPC_B040": [
    "That is the hold we have",
    "on them: ultraviolet",
    "against artificial skin.",
    "A graft needs six months",
    "at the very least before",
    "it settles for good."
  ],
  "CPC_B050": [
    "So there are ways to tell",
    "a Snatcher from a man.",
    "",
    "(1) Look at the skin.",
    "    Check it for the",
    "    melanoma."
  ],
  "CPC_B060": [
    "(2) Use your nose.",
    "    Skin that",
    "    has turned",
    "    gives off a",
    "    stench of",
    "    its own."
  ],
  "CPC_B070": [
    "(3) Look for pollen.",
    "    They hole up",
    "    where Snow",
    "    Cedar grows",
    "    so it shows",
    "    up wherever",
    "    they do."
  ],
  "CPC_B080": [
    "Snow Cedar is an allergen.",
    "It brings on sore throats",
    "and sneezing fits."
  ],
  "CPC_B090": [
    "(4) Sun screen.",
    "    A Snatcher wears it in",
    "    the dead of winter to",
    "    keep the ultraviolet",
    "    off its skin."
  ],
  "CPC_B0A0": [
    "Sun screen stops the rays",
    "that burn and the rays",
    "that tan, and those are",
    "the ones doing the damage."
  ],
  "CPC_B0B0": [
    "Of the four, the skin and",
    "the sun screen are the",
    "leads worth following.",
    "And prevention is not the",
    "whole of it: skin that has",
    "turned has to be treated."
  ],
  "CPC_B0C0": [
    "...and I have found the",
    "hospital that treats it.",
    "",
    "PS.",
    "Watch out for a bounty",
    "hunter, Randam Hajile."
  ]
}